# Slash-free patterns match at any depth; the ** forms below are explicit about
# it so a new workspace under apps/ or packages/ is covered without an edit.
**/node_modules
**/dist
data
work
.git
.worktrees
.superpowers
*.md
.claude/

# The packaged desktop app. MEASURED at 812 MB of an 814 MB build context —
# the .dmg, the unpacked .app, and a whole Electron runtime — none of which the
# server image contains a single byte of. Everything else in the context put
# together is about 2 MB, so this one line is essentially the entire cost of a
# `docker build` here.
#
# `release/` rather than all of `apps/desktop`: the Dockerfile's build stage
# does `COPY apps ./apps`, and dropping a whole workspace out of a tree whose
# lockfile still lists it is the kind of change that surfaces as a confusing
# `npm ci` failure rather than a clean one.
apps/desktop/release

# Build artifacts that should never reach a build context regardless of where
# they are produced.
*.dmg
*.blockmap
*.tsbuildinfo
release
